{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marshals of Yore is a different and simpler approach to classical RTS. It's easy to play, yet challenging.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/78ab42308cafa5e4343b8bab7dfbc246.avif?t=1772889834\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ perks to choose from during battle to finesse your build. Even a common perk can be crucial for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/4b06bbdee25384295353fc6f3ccbb896.avif?t=1772889834\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your army by picking a marshal, equipping items, selecting a background and spell. There are so many variations to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/bb8881eac0c6bb4288faee4dc86ee461.avif?t=1772889834\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units for coming battles; the enemy gets stronger every stage. And let's not forget, you will need all the help for the endless mode!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Xmas came early!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868490/5cda84e18a0bcefca48248b4f3fcf9e4524097f2.jpg"},{"name":"A true knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868490/5fc7db1863c077ceda4d8f5facaa3aaf81dc6b10.jpg"},{"name":"The engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868490/3f89168f0e3d66dc9c8f9e846c02f08cabcf1d19.jpg"},{"name":"Mete's Aim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/